  "title": "Other AI Providers: OpenAI-Compatible Endpoints, Ollama and Azure AI Inference | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "Azure OpenAI is one way to bring a model to your CrestApps site. This video shows the other providers: OpenAI and OpenAI-compatible services such as DeepSeek, Gemini and Together AI, Ollama for local models, and Azure AI Inference, as connections and deployments.\n\nIn this video:\n• The providers and what each is for\n• An OpenAI-compatible connection with its own endpoint\n• An Ollama connection\n• An Azure AI Inference connection and its authentication types\n• Adding a deployment, and read-only items from the configuration",
